:Store File Name Routines

     Routine Name:  MFNn
Š     Functionº

     Storå appropriatå outpuô intï memorù aô buffeò  pointeä 
tï bù HL®  FCB+± ió pointeä tï bù DÅ oî input®  Foò MFN± anä 
MFN3¬  thå  numbeò  oæ characteró storeä wilì alwayó bå  12®  
Foò MFN2¬  thå numbeò oæ characteró storeä ió  varying¬  buô 
will never exceed 12.

     Inputs:  DE pts to FCB+1
              HL pts to memory buffer

     Outputs:  None (Characters are stored in memory buffer)

     Registers Affected:  None
     SYSLIB Routines Called:  None
     Special Error Conditions:  None

     Notes:

     1®   Uså  oæ  MFN± anä MFN³ ió  quitå  straight-forwarä 
sincå   theù  alwayó  filì  exactlù  1²  byteó  oæ   memory®  
Advancinç  tï  thå  nexô bytå afteò thå lasô bytå  ió  quitå 
simple, as the following code illustrates:

          ...
          LXI  D,FCB+1   ; pt to FN field
          LXI  H,BUFFER  ; pt to buffer
          CALL MFN1      ; store name
          LXI  B,12      ; skip to after last byte
          DAD  B         ;   by adding 12 to HL
          ...


     2®   Uså oæ MFN² ió noô quitå aó straight-forwarä sincå 
iô  filló aô mosô 1² bytes¬  buô coulä filì lesó thaî  this®  
Thió probleí caî bå eliminateä bù usinç thå FILLÂ anä  SKNSĞ 
routines, as illustrated:

          ...
          LXI  H,BUFFER  ; pt to buffer
          MVI  B,13      ; fill following 13 bytes with
          MVI  A,' '     ;   spaces
          CALL FILLB
          LXI  D,FCB+1   ; pt to FN field
          CALL MFN2      ; store name
          CALL SKNSP     ; skip over non-spaces (HL now
                         ;   points to after last character)
          ...

